<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen ups Intel EPS view.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cowen ups Intel EPS view.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Cowen &amp; Co raised its 1996 earnings estimate on Intel Corp to $5.51 a share from $5.37 a share, a Cowen source said.</p>
<p>-- Cowen also raised its 1997 earnings estimate to $7.80 a share from $6.90 a share, a Cowen source said.</p>
<p>-- Cowen reiterated its strong buy rating on Intel, a Cowen source said.</p>
<p>-- Intel gained 2-5/8 to 141 in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
